      "simplified": "“她没吃，你给她这个，她喜欢吃这个。”小亮给了钱多多一些吃的。",
      "traditional": "“她沒吃，你給她這個，她喜歡吃這個。”小亮給了錢多多一些吃的。",
      "pinyin": "tā méi chī nǐ gěi tā zhè ge tā xǐ huan chī zhè ge xiǎo liàng gěi le qián duō duō yì xiē chī de",
      "english": "“She hasn’t eaten. Give her this one. She likes to eat this one,” Little Liang gave Qian Duoduo something to eat."
    },
