      "pinyin": "qián duō duō zài xiǎo gǒu de qián miàn tā kàn xiǎo gǒu chī dōng xi tā kàn xiǎo gǒu hē shuǐ",
      "english": "Qian Duoduo was in front of the little dog. She watched the little dog eat and watched the little dog drink water."
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "她很高兴，她不累了。",
      "traditional": "她很高興，她不累了。",
      "pinyin": "tā hěn gāo xìng tā bú lèi le",
      "english": "She was very happy. She was no longer tired."
    }
