    "sentence_translations": [
      "(3) Qian Duoduo Is No Longer Tired",
      "",
      "Qian Duoduo was in the pet store looking at a little dog. She didn’t have an owner.",
      "",
      "“How old is she?” Qian Duoduo asked.",
      "",
      "“One year old? Two years old? I don’t know,” Little Liang said.",
      "",
      "“What is her name?”",
      "",
      "“She doesn’t have a name.”",
      "",
      "“Has she eaten yet? Can I give her something to eat?”",
      "",
      "“She hasn’t eaten. Give her this one. She likes to eat this one,” Little Liang gave Qian Duoduo something to eat.",
      "",
      "Qian Duoduo had worked for a whole day. Before she came to the pet store, she was very tired, but she was fine now.",
      "Qian Duoduo was in front of the little dog. She watched the little dog eat and watched the little dog drink water.",
      "She was very happy. She was no longer tired."
    ]
